"Currently, we have mice that are four months old and no longer suffer from diabetes, despite having had the condition earlier," he added.   "Hozir bizda diabetga ega bo'lgan, lekin keyinroq diabetga ega bo'lmagan to'rt oylik mushuklar mavjud," dedi u.
Dr. Ehud Ur, a professor of medicine at Dalhousie University in Halifax, Nova Scotia, and chair of the clinical and scientific division of the Canadian Diabetes Association, emphasized that while the findings are promising, more long-term studies are needed to confirm their effectiveness.   Dr. Ehud Ur, Halifax, Novaya Skotiya, Dalhousie universiteti tibbiyot professori va Kanada diabet assotsiatsiyasining klinik va ilmiy bo‘limi rahbari, natijalar umidli bo‘lsada, ularning samarali ekanligini tasdiqlash uchun ko‘proq uzoq muddatli tadqiqotlar kerakligini ta'kidladi.
He emphasizes that while the research shows promise for preventing diabetes in at-risk individuals, it does not offer a cure for those already living with the condition.	Ushbu tadqiqotning riskli shaxslar uchun diabetni oldini olishda yordam berishini ko'rsatishini, lekin allaqachon shu kasallikka ega bo'lgan odamlar uchun davolash usuli bo'lmaganini ta'kidlaydi.
Sara Danius, the Swedish Academy’s permanent secretary for Literature, revealed in a televised interview that the Nobel Committee had attempted multiple times to contact Bob Dylan regarding his 2016 Literature Prize, but due to his unavailability, they had to proceed without his direct confirmation.   Sara Danius, Shvetsiya Akademiyasining adabiyot bo‘yicha doimiy sekretari, teleboshlovda aytib o‘tgan bo‘yicha, 2016-yilgi adabiyot NobeL mukofotini qabul qilish bo‘yicha Bob Dylan bilan muloqot qilish uchun ko‘plab urinishlar qilingan, lekin uning mavjud bo‘lmasligi tufayli ular uning to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri tasdiqlashini kutishni tashlab ketishdi.
Danius added, "We're currently waiting for further information, but I've already reached out to his team through calls and emails, and the responses have been very positive and encouraging."   Danius qo‘shimcha qildi: "Hozir biz boshqa ma'lumotlarni kutayotganimizda, men uning jamoasiga ariza yuborib, telefon qilganman, va javoblar juda ijobiy hamda qo‘llab-quvvatlovchi bo‘ldi."
Siminoff later explained that the idea for Ring emerged from a personal experience of feeling unsafe while working from home, prompting him to create a smart doorbell with real-time video monitoring.   Siminoff keyin o‘z uyida ishlash paytida xavfsizlik hissini sezib, haqiqiy vaqtli video nazoratini taqdim etadigan ajoyib darajadagi darvozachani yaratishga undagan shaxsiy tajribasidan Ring fikri kelib chiqqanini izohladı.
