In early 2018, Siminoff launched a crowdfunding campaign on Kickstarter to further develop his smart home device.	2018-yilning boshlarida Siminoff o'zining smart uy qurilmasiini rivojlantirish uchun Kickstarterda fond yig'ish kampaniyasini boshladi.
