Although a promising experimental treatment has shown potential in improving survival rates for Ebola patients, effective therapies for active infections remain limited.   Xo‘sh, tajriba qilinayotgan davolash usuli Ebola kasalliklarida o‘limni kamaytirishda yaxshi natijaga erishgan bo‘lsada, mavjud infektsiyalarni davolash uchun samarali dori vositalari hali ham cheklangan.
Although the experimental drug remdesivir demonstrated some effectiveness in early trials, later clinical data showed only modest improvements in recovery rates for severe COVID-19 patients.   Tibbiy tadqiqotlarda remdesivir doriyasi boshlang'ich sinovlarda muvaffaqiyatli ko'rinib, keyinroq klinik ma'lumotlar yengil COVID-19 kasalliklarida faqat kamroq yaxshilanishlarni ko'rsatdi.
In the PALM trial, ZMapp was used as a control group, allowing researchers to evaluate the effectiveness of the three experimental treatments against a standard reference.   PALM tajribasida ZMapp nazorat guruhiga sifatida ishlatildi, bu esa o‘zgarishlarni standart solishtirish asosida uchta tajriba dori-darmonlarining samaradorligini baholash imkonini berdi.
USA Gymnastics has reaffirmed its commitment to athlete safety and cooperation with the U.S. Olympic Committee in implementing comprehensive reforms across the sport.   USA Gimnastikasi sportda kengaytirilgan ishlar amalga oshirishda Olimpiya komiteti bilan hamkorlik qilish va atletlarning xavfsizligiga qo‘shimcha e'tibor berishga bo‘lgan o‘zining muloyimatini takrorladi.
The decision to pursue internal reforms reflects a commitment to strengthening the foundation of the sport for future generations.	Shu tariqa ichki islohotlarga qaratilish, kelajak avlodlar uchun sportning asosini mustahkamlashga bo'lgan muloyimatni anglatadi.
