During the 1970s, Brzezinski served as a key foreign policy advisor to President Jimmy Carter, playing a major role in shaping U.S. relations with the Soviet Union and other global powers.   1970-yillarda Brzezinski Jeyms Karter prezidentining asosiy xalqaro siyosat maslahatchisi sifatida ishlagan, AQSHning Sovet Ittifoqi va boshqa global kuchlar bilan aloqalari siyosatini shakllantirishda muhim rol o'ynagan.
