As National Security Advisor, he played a key role in shaping U.S. foreign policy during critical global events, including the signing of the Camp David Accords, efforts to normalize relations with China, the aftermath of the Iranian Revolution, and the response to the Soviet invasion of Afghanistan.   Boshqa xavfsizlik masalalari bo‘yicha milliy xavfsizlik maslahatchisi sifatida u AQSH xalqaro siyosatini muhim global voqealarda shakllantirishda asosiy rol o‘ynadi, jumladan, Camp David shartnomasini imzolash, Xitoy bilan aloqalarni normalizatsiyalash harakatlarini, Eron inqilobining natijalari va Afg‘onistonga Sovet armiyasining invaziyasi reaksiyasi.
The film, starring Ryan Gosling and Emma Stone, won multiple awards at the prestigious ceremony, including Best Picture and Best Director.   Filmda Ryan Gosling va Emma Stone bosh roly o'ynagan bo'lib, nihoyat mazkur tashkilotda "Eng yaxshi film" va "Eng yaxshi rejissyor" kabi bir nechta mukofotlarni qo'lga kiritdi.
