The Rossby number helps astronomers understand how magnetic activity in stars correlates with their internal rotation and energy transport.   Rossby soni yulduzlar ichidagi magnit faollikning ularning ichki aylanishiga va energiya uzatilishiga qanday bog'liq ekanligini tushunishda yordam beradi.
