The 802.11ac standard, an advanced Wi-Fi protocol, supports even higher data transfer speeds by utilizing the 5.0GHz frequency band exclusively.   802.11ac standarti, yuqori tezlikdagi ma'lumotlarni uzatishni ta'minlaydigan, 5,0 GHz chastotasi bandini faqat boshqaruvchi yuqori darajadagi Wi-Fi protokoli.
The new wireless standard enables seamless integration with older devices, as long as the router supports both 2.4 GHz and 5 GHz frequency bands.	 Yangi bevosita standart eski qurilmalarga bevosita ulanish imkonini beradi, shartki, router 2,4 GHz va 5 GHz chastotalarini qo'llab-quvvatlashi kerak.
The 802.11ac standard offers even greater speeds, with a maximum theoretical data rate of up to 1.3 Gbit/s, making it ideal for high-bandwidth applications like 4K video streaming.   802.11ac standarti yanada yuqori tezliklarga ega bo'lib, maksimal teorektik ma'lumot o'tkazish tezligi 1,3 Gbit/s gacha yetadi, bu esa 4K video streaming kabi yuqori bandli kengaytirilgan dasturlar uchun mos keladi.
