In a thrilling match at Eden Park, New Zealand narrowly defeated South Africa to claim the Rugby Championship title.   Eden Parkda o‘tkazilgan jangovar uchrashuvda Yangi Zelandiya Gavjotlarni yengib, Ragbi chempionatining yutuqini qo‘lga kiritdi.
The match ended in a dramatic last-minute try, securing a narrow 24-22 win for the Springboks and ending their long-standing rivalry with New Zealand on a high note.   O'yin so'nggi daqiqalarda g'ayratli to'g'ri yutuq bilan yakunlandi va Springboks uchun 24:22 g'alaba qozonishiga olib keldi, bu esa ularning Yangi Zelandiyaga qarshi uzoq muddatli raqobatini yaxshi natijada yakunlashiga imkon berdi.
For the Springboks, this victory marked their first win in over a year, signaling a strong comeback in international rugby.   Springboklar uchun bu g‘alaba yilga yaqin muddat davom etgan xalqaro ragbi bo‘yicha yengilishlar ketma-ketligini yakunlashi bilan birga, kuchli qaytishni belgiladi.
