The seismic activity was felt across several counties, with residents reporting strong shaking and minor structural damage in the towns of Virginia City and Nevada City.   Seysmik hodisa bir nechta okruglarda his qilindi, Virginia City va Nevada City shaharlari aholisi kuchli siljish va kichik binolarda shikastlanishlarni aytishdi.
The discovery of the H5N1 virus in a wild duck has prompted health authorities in eastern France to issue warnings about potential risks to both wildlife and poultry.   Lyonning sharqiy qismidagi suvli joylarda dushanba kuni topilgan o‘tgan o‘rmon qushida H5N1 virusi aniqlanganligi, Fransiyaning sharqiy hududidagi sog‘liqni saqlash xodimlarini vahshiy qushlar hamda chuchuklar uchun potentsial xavf haqida ogohlantirishga undagan.
Spain has become the eighth country in the European Union to report cases of the virus, following the same sequence of nations.   Ispaniya virusning 8-mamlakati bo'lib, avvalgi mamlakatlar ketma-ketligini qo'lyo'qlashdi.
Authorities in Croatia and Denmark are currently investigating several bird deaths linked to potential avian influenza outbreaks, though no definitive cases of H5N1 have been reported yet.   Xorijiy qushlar gripiga bog‘liq bo‘lgan bir nechta qush o‘limlari haqida Xorvatiya va Daniyada hozirgi vaqtda tekshiruvlar olib borilmoqda, lekin H5N1 ning aniq hollari hali tasdiqlanmagan.
