Chambers, who identifies as an agnostic, claims that the lawsuit is baseless and that "anyone can file a lawsuit against anyone else."   Chambers, a shubhasizlikka ega bo'lgan shaxs, ishni bevosita va "har kim har qanday kishiga shikoyat qilishini" aytadi.
