Mexican athlete Arly Velasquez, who competed in the men's sitting Super-G, secured a fifteenth-place finish, while New Zealander Adam Hall claimed ninth position in the men's standing Super-G event.   Meksikali sportchi Arly Velasquez, erkaklar uchun yotib yugurishdagi Super-G musobaqasida o'ntalab o'rinni qo'lga kiritdi, shu bilan birga, Novaya Zelandiyalik Adam Hall erkaklar uchun turg'un yugurishdagi Super-G musobaqasida to'qqizinchilik o'rinni qo'lga kiritdi.
