Before joining The Simpsons, Simon had gained experience working on multiple animated series in roles ranging from writer to storyboard artist.   "The Simpsons" ga qo‘shilishdan oldin Simon boshqa animatsion seriallarda yozuvchi va sketsa artisti kabi turli lavozimlarda ishlagan.
In the 1990s, he transitioned to film, starring in several critically acclaimed movies that showcased his versatility as an actor.   1990-yillarda u kinoga o‘tib, aktyor sifatida ko‘plab mehnat qilingan filmga ishtirok etdi.
In 1991, he co-created the animated series "The Critic" with Al Jean and Mike Reiss, serving as executive producer and guiding the show’s satirical tone.   1991-yilda u Al Jean va Mike Reiss bilan birga "The Critic" animatsion seriyasini yaratdi va shouning satirik uslubini boshqaruvchi bosh muharrir bo'ldi.
Even after stepping down from the show in 1993, he retained the role of executive producer and continued to earn millions of dollars in royalties each season.   1993-yilda shoudan chiqqanidan so'ng ham u boshqaruvchi produser bo'lib qolishini saqlab, har mavsum millionlab dollarni nafaqaga olishiga davom etdi.
