Iran has faced repeated challenges in modernizing its aviation infrastructure, leading to frequent safety concerns in both civilian and military air travel.   Iran o‘z aviatsiya infrastrukturasi modernizatsiyasini rivojlantirishda takrorlanuvchi qiyinchiliklarga duch kelmoqda, bu esa fuqarolik va harbiy havo transportida doimiy xavfsizlik muammolariga olib kelmoqda.
