In a separate incident, a passenger plane operated by Ukraine International Airlines crashed near Tehran in January, resulting in the loss of all 176 people on board.   Boshqa voqea sifatida, Yanvar oyida Ukraina Xalqaro Airlaynning boshqaruvchisi tomonidan boshqariladigan pasyent samolyoti Tegeron yaqinida halok bo'ldi va 176 nafar kishining o'limiga sabab bo'ldi.
