In recent years, tourism at Machu Picchu has increased significantly, prompting authorities to implement stricter visitor management policies.   So'nggi yillarda Machu Picchu'dagi turizm sezilarli darajada oshdi, bu esa hokimiyatni tashqi sayyohlar boshqaruvini qat'iyroq qo'llashga majbur qildi.
The widespread adoption of digital cameras has led to a significant decline in the use of traditional film, even though 35mm remains a popular choice among professional photographers.	Butun dunyoda raqamli kameraning keng tarqalishi, 35mm filmning professional fotografikar uchun ham yaxshi tanlov bo'lishiga qaramay, an'anaviy film foydalanishini muhim darajada kamaytirdi.
Although film photography has declined significantly, the 35mm format remains influential in modern digital imaging standards.	Sifatli fotografik nashrning deyarli bevosita kamayib ketgani hamda 35mm formati so'nggi yillarda modern raqamli tasvir tizimlarida ta'sir qilishda davom etmoqda.
The 35mm film format, despite its name, measures 36 millimeters in width and 24 millimeters in height, making it slightly larger than the label suggests.   35mm kinofilm formati, nomi shunchaki, 36 millimetr eni va 24 millimetr balandligi bilan, nomidan ko'ra bir oz kattaroq.
The 3:2 aspect ratio is commonly used in photography and is particularly favored for its balanced and aesthetically pleasing composition.   Bu 3:2 nisbati fotografiyada keng qo'llaniladi va uning muvozanatli va estetik ko'rinishi sababli ajoyib tanlovdir.
Many modern smartphones feature screen aspect ratios that closely match the 16:9 standard used in high-definition video and television.   Ko'plab zamonaviy smartfonlarning ekrani yuqori aniqlikli video va televiziyada ishlatiladigan 16:9 nisbatiga yaqin yoki aniq mos keladi.
The rule of space, another fundamental principle in photography, suggests leaving empty room in the direction a subject is looking or moving to create a sense of movement and natural flow.	 Fotografiyada boshqa asosiy qoida bo'lgan "joy qoldirish qoidasi" ob'ektning qarash yoki harakatlanish yo'nalishida bo'sh joy qoldirishni tavsiya qiladi, bu esa harakat va tabiiy oqim hissini beradi.
The rule of thirds is widely used in photography and cinematography to create balanced and visually appealing compositions by placing key elements along these intersecting lines or their surrounding areas.	Trikotaj qoidasi fotografik va kinematografik asarlarda muvozanatli va estetik jihatdan jozibador tuzilmalarni yaratish uchun keng qo'llaniladi, asosiy elementlarni rasmni uch qismga bo'lish chiziklari yoki ularning atrofidagi sohalarga joylashtirish orqali.
