Located deep within the rugged terrain of the Hijaz mountains, the cave offers a serene retreat for pilgrims seeking solitude and reflection.	Hijoz tog‘larining qiyin joyida joylashgan, bu gavjum o‘rmonlarda yashab, ibodat qilish uchun tushunish va fikr yig‘ish uchun sayyohlar uchun sadoqatli joy bo‘lib xizmat qiladi.
