Multiple Sclerosis affects more than 2.8 million people worldwide, making it one of the most common disabling neurological conditions in young adults.   Multiple skleroz dunyodagi 2,8 milliondan ortiq kishini ta'sir qiladi va yoshlarning yoshlari uchun eng ko'p uchraydigan o'lik bo'lmagan neyronaviy kasalliklardan biri hisoblanadi.
Multiple sclerosis (MS) is a chronic autoimmune condition that can lead to a wide range of neurological symptoms, including vision problems, muscle weakness, and coordination difficulties.   Multiple skleroz (MS) — bu ayniqsa ko'z nervi, beyin va miya suyagini qamrab oladigan xronik immunogenetik kasallik bo'lib, ko'z ko'rish, mushak kuchsizligi va muvozanatni saqlash qiyinchiliklariga olib keladi.
