In many developed nations, public infrastructure such as subway systems and power grids is regularly maintained, reducing the likelihood of major failures.	Manyoq rivojlangan mamlakatlarda, metro tizimlari va elektr tarmoqlari kabi axborot infratuzilmasi doimiy ravishda saqlanadi, bu katta xatoliklarning sodir bo‘lish ehtimoli kamaytiriladi.
