Vatican City's population is composed entirely of members of the Roman Catholic Church, with no other religious affiliations present.   Vatikan shahar davlatining aholisi butunlay Rim katoliklari tarkibida tuzilgan bo'lib, boshqa diniy qo‘shimchalar mavjud emas.
Ancient civilizations were able to produce bronze by combining copper and tin, a process that marked a major advancement in early metallurgy.   Qadimgi madaniyatlar mis va qo‘rg‘oshinni birlashtirib bronza ishlab chiqishni, bu esa qadimgi metallurgiyadagi katta taraqqiyotni belgilagan.
Aristotle, a renowned ancient Greek philosopher, believed that the natural world could be explained through the interaction of four fundamental elements: earth, water, air, and fire.   Aristotel, qadimgi Yaxshilik Greciyasining mashhur falsafachisi, tabiiy dunyoning tushuntirilishini to'rtta asosiy elementlarning o'zaro ta'sirida ko'rishini taxmin qilgan: yer, suv, havo va og'och.
The scientist proposed that under extreme conditions, matter could transition into a fifth state, known as a Bose-Einstein condensate, which behaves very differently from the traditional four states.	Olim ekstremal shartlar ostida modda beshinchi holatga, ya'ni Bose-Eynshteyn kondensatiga o'tishi mumkinligini taklif qildi, bu holat klassik to'rtta holatdan juda farq qiladi.
Alloys are widely used in engineering and construction due to their enhanced strength and resistance to corrosion.	Alloylar mustaqil metallar bilan solishtirganda yengilroq, mustahkamroq va korroziyaga chidamli bo‘lishi sababli, muhandislik va qurilish sohasida keng qo‘llaniladi.
While some elements such as sodium and magnesium are classified as metals due to their conductivity and luster, others like sulfur and chlorine are non-metals with entirely different properties.	Suyuq natriy va magniy kabi elementlar o'tkazuvchanligi va metallik shaffofliklari tufayli metallar sifatida klassifikatsiyalangan bo'lsa, sulfat va xlor kabi boshqalari noma'lum xususiyatlarga ega bo'lgani uchun metall emaslar.
You can also create composite materials by combining polymers with reinforcing fibers such as carbon or glass.	Siz karbon yoki steklo kabi o‘rnatilgan atroflovchilardan tashkil topgan polimerlarni birlashtirish orqali kompozit materiallar yaratishingiz mumkin.
Even though atoms are incredibly small, they are the fundamental building blocks of everything we see around us.	Atomlar juda kichik bo'lishiga qaramay, biz ko'ramiz bo'lgan barcha narsalarning asosiy qurilish elementlari hisoblanadi.
Even the smallest visible speck of dust contains billions of atoms, each one far too small to be seen with the naked eye.	 Eng kichik ko'rinadigan to'qqa ham milliardlab atomlar mavjud bo'lib, ularning har biri aynan ko'z bilan ko'rinadigan darajada kichik.
In the early days of digital technology, many people still preferred using paper and pencils for note-taking and sketching.	Butun dunyoda raqamli texnologiyalarning dastlabki kunlarida ko'plar hali ham qog'oz va qalam bilan eslatmalar yozish va chizishni afzal ko'rdi.
Despite the rise of digital technology, pencils remain a popular choice among artists and students for their simplicity and reliability.	Butun dunyoda raqamli texnologiyalarning keng tarqalishi bilan birga, qalam hali ham chizmachi va talabalarning osonlik va ishonchlilik sababli sevimli voshasi bo'lib qolmoqda.
Now, students can take digital notes on tablets, eliminating the need to carry around physical pencils and erasers.   Hozir, talabalar qog‘ozda yozish o‘rniga planshetda raqamli qayd qilish imkonini oladilar, bu esa qalam va rezina olib chiqishni yo‘qotishga olib keladi.
