It's similar to compressing a spring and then letting it go—when the nucleus splits, stored energy is suddenly released.	 Bu prujinani siqishga va keyin osib yuborishga o'xshaydi—nukleus bo'linishida saqlangan energiya tezda osib chiqadi.
