The discovery of new neural pathways has provided valuable insights into how the brain processes emotions and decision-making.	Neuron yo‘llarining yangi kashfiyoti umid qilinadigan emotsiyalarni va qaror qabul qilish jarayonini boshqarishdagi ajoyib tushunchalarga olib kelgan.
