Blogging helps students develop critical thinking skills by encouraging them to reflect on their experiences and share insights with a global audience.	Blogging o‘quvchilarga o‘z tajribalarini tekshirish va dunyo bo‘ylab ajoyib fikrlarni ulashish imkonini beradi, shu bilan birga ularning mantiqiy fikrlash ko‘nikmalarini rivojlantiradi.
