Many of the larger islands in the region are home to diverse ecosystems and are protected as nature reserves to preserve their unique wildlife.   Bir nechta katta orollar mintaqada turli ekotizimlarga ega bo'lib, ularning noyob hayvonotini saqlash uchun tabiiy yashash joylari sifatida himoya qilinadi.
