The region's climate varies significantly, with the northern areas experiencing a dry savanna climate and the southern coastal zones receiving heavy rainfall throughout the year.   Boshqa hududlarning iqlimi sezilarli darajada farq qiladi: shimoliy hududlarda quruq savanna iqlimi, janubiy sohil hududlari esa yil bo‘yi ko‘p yomg‘ir oladi.
