Cross-country skiing, while sharing some equipment with alpine touring, typically involves flat or gently rolling terrain and uses lighter, more flexible skis and boots designed for endurance rather than steep ascents.   Kross-kontinental skiyozish alpin turdagi skiyozish bilan bog‘liq bo'lishi mumkin, lekin odatda tekis yoki nisbatan yumaloq yerlarda amalga oshiriladi va yengil, ko'proq elastik skiyolar va o'zlashtirish uchun uzoq muddatli yurishga mo'ljallangan yengil tayyorgarliklar ishlatiladi.
