The Schengen Area allows for passport-free travel among most European Union countries, making cross-border journeys much smoother and more convenient.   Shengen zonasida Yevropa Ittifoqi mamlakatlari o‘rtasida pasportsiz harakatlanish imkonini beradi, bu esa chegarani o‘tishni ko‘proq oson va qulay qiladi.
In contrast, the Schengen Area allows for the free movement of people across internal borders, making travel between member countries seamless and efficient.   Buni qarama-qarshi tarzda, Schengen hududi ichidagi ichki chegaralardan o'tishga erishish imkonini beradi, shu bilan birga a'zolar orasidagi sayohatlar oson va samarali bo'ladi.
As long as you remain within the Schengen Area, you can typically travel between member countries without encountering border checks.   Shengen zonasida bo‘lishingizni davom ettirgan hollarda, a'zolikdagi mamlakatlarga o‘tishda cheklovlar bilan duch kelishingiz ehtimoli kam.
With a Schengen visa, travelers can move freely across 26 European countries without needing additional visas, making international travel more convenient and efficient.   Schengen viza egasi 26 ta Yevropa mamlakatlariga alohida viza so'rovlari berishsiz bevosita harakat qilish huquqiga ega bo'lib, xalqaro sayohatni oson va samarali qiladi.
