Make sure the bus route you're planning to take includes a stop in Hebron, as some buses only go as far as the adjacent Israeli settlement of Kiryat Arba.   Siz o'ylab turgan avtobus Hebronga borishini, balki faqat Kiryat Arba nomli yaqin joydagi yahudiy yashash joyiga borishini tekshiring.
Exploring scenic river valleys by kayak or canoe offers a peaceful and immersive way to experience nature.	Kanal yoki kano bilan go‘zal daryo vallaylarini quyoshda yurish tabiatni sadoqatli va chuqur tushunishning ajoyib usulidir.
Exploring historic cities like Prague, Budapest, or Vienna offers travelers a rich blend of architecture, culture, and scenic river views.	Prag, Budyon, yoki Vena kabi tarixiy shaharlarni tekshirish sayyohlar uchun arxitektura, madaniyat va go‘zal suv yo‘llari ko‘rinishini birlashtiradi.
They also provide detailed maps and safety guidelines for mountain climbing expeditions in the region.   Ular mintaqadagi tog‘ ko‘tarilish sayohatlariga oid batafsil xaritalar va xavfsizlik ko‘rsatmalarini ham taqdim etadilar.
Easter is another major Christian holiday, commemorating the resurrection of Jesus Christ.	Paskha Yisus Kristonning qaytishini xotiraga olish uchun nishonlanadigan boshqa muhim xristianlik bayramidir.
In recent years, the celebration of Diwali has gained popularity not only among Hindus but also in various non-Hindu communities across Europe and North America.	So'nggi yillarda Diwali nafasini Hindu jamoalari bilan birga Yevropada ham, Shimoliy Amerikada ham turli xudayon bo'lmagan jama'iyatlarda ham mashhur bo'ldi.
In many mountainous regions, people gather at high-altitude locations before dawn to celebrate the arrival of spring with traditional songs and dances.	 Bir nechta tog‘li hududlarda kunduzdan oldin bahor kelishini nishonlash uchun yuqori balandlikdagi joylarga yig‘ilish va ota-ona oshiq qo‘shiq va o‘yinlar bilan nishonlash adabiyoti mavjud.
Many scholars believe that the celebration of Easter incorporates elements from ancient pagan festivals honoring the arrival of spring and the renewal of life.	 Bir nechta olimlar, Paskha bayrami bahor va hayotning yangilanishini nishonlaydigan qadimgi yahudiy bayramlaridan elementlarni o‘z ichiga olganini taxmin qilishadi.
Many Orthodox Christian communities observe the Easter Eve service on Friday night, continuing through the night with hymns, prayers, and the lighting of candles to symbolize the light of Christ.	Manya ortodokslar mazkur Eslom kuni juma kechasi soat 24:00 gacha nashr etilgan xayriyalar, duolar va nurlar yonishini o'tkazish orqali Xristosning qaytishini belgilaydi.
Many of the unique species found on the Galápagos Islands evolved in isolation, with some arriving via ocean currents and others carried by wind over long distances.   Galápagos orollari yashash joyida uchraydigan ko'plab noyob turlar izolyatsiyada rivojlanib, ularning ba'zilari okean oqimlari orqali, ba'zilari esa uzoq masofani o'tib, shamol tomonidan olib kelinadi.
As a result of the islands' isolation, unique species like the Galapagos finches evolved without natural predators, allowing them to thrive in diverse ecological niches.   Jazoralarning izolyatsiyasi tufayli Galapagos pichonlari kabi noyob turlar tabiiy mehmonlarsiz, turli ekologik o'rinlarda rivojlanishga imkon berilgan.
The introduction of invasive species has significantly disrupted the natural ecosystem of the Galapagos Islands, threatening native wildlife.	Galapagos orollaridagi invaziv turlarning kiritilishi tabiiy ekosistema uchun jiddiy xavf yaratdi va mahalliy hayvonlarga xavf tug'dirdi.
During the summer months in the Arctic, travelers can witness the midnight sun, where the sun remains above the horizon for 24 hours or more.   Arktikadagi yoz oylarida sayyohlar yarim kunduzni ko'rishlari mumkin, bu esa quyosh 24 soat yoki undan ko'proq vaqt bo'ylab horizondan yuqoriga chiqishini anglatadi.
